sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant E as AgentModeExecutor
    participant G as generateText
    participant R as ToolRegistry / MCP
    participant A as ArtifactStore

    U->>E: prompt + mode (e.g. research)
    E->>E: look up contract & plugin
    E->>G: system prompt + tools
    G-->>E: tool_call: web_search
    E->>R: execute tool
    R-->>E: search results
    E->>G: results + continue
    G-->>E: tool_call: file_write
    E->>R: execute tool
    R-->>E: written artifact
    E->>E: validate evidence
    E->>A: emit artifact
    E-->>U: MODE_EXECUTION_COMPLETE
